<title>USA: Professionals Insurance Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Professionals Insurance Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>OKEMOS, Mich. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME</p>
<p> for the three months ended September 30,   1996	   1995</p>
<p>Premiums earned, net		    $14,120,593   $13,721,593</p>
<p>Investment income, net		    3,853,137     3,909,921</p>
<p>Net realized investment gains (losses)(103,435)	 478,246</p>
<p>Net income				    2,396,325     2,548,091</p>
<p>Net income per common share		    0.75	    0.85</p>
<p>	 CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME</p>
<p> for the nine months ended September 30,   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Premiums earned, net		    $42,544,261   $41,405,069</p>
<p>Investment income, net		   11,557,819    10,629,575</p>
<p>Net realized investment gains (losses)(479,524)	 389,020</p>
<p>Net income (loss)			   6,882,045   (2,376,681)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common share	   2.18	 ( 0.75)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Professionals Insurance Company Management Group.</p>
